WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.100
I don't know why you're doing this, but my instincts tell me that you're not the person from before.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.030
You're not Marik!

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:29.920
Nonsense!

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:35.240
This Millennium Rod proves I'm Marik!

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.850
Finish him, Mystical Beast of Serket!

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:39.950
Attack Jonouchi directly!

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.180
Sorry, Yugi.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.150
It's over for me.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.660
- Jonouchi!
- Brother!

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.620
Jonouchi!

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:47.850
Stop, Rishido!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:48.890
Don't attack!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.360
Master Marik, why?

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:00.030
Use the God Card to defeat Jonouchi!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:06.040
Ra's Anger
Stand Up, Jonouchi!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.660
Rishido...

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:17.200
If you're a Gravekeeper, your strong heart will allow you to control the copy of the God Card.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.970
But I...

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:28.160
If you can control the copy of the God Card, my deceased father will accept you as his son.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:32.310
As a true successor to the family instead of a phony.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:39.280
Please!  This may not be your desire, but let me undergo the ritual to become your son!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.000
You fool!  You're only a servant!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:49.380
If you speak about my family's secrets again, I'll cut off your tongue!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.360
Leave!

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.600
Prove that you're part of the family, Rishido!

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.970
Why won't he attack?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:20.280
I'll prove that I possess a God Card this turn.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.950
A God Card?

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:25.380
Is he going to summon the card inside the ark?

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:29.860
The God Card is currently inside the ark.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:36.820
To open the ark, I must give up Mystical Beast of Serket and half my life points.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:42.430
But that will release The Winged Dragon of Ra to the field.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.370
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.540
I offer Mystical Beast of Serket and a portion of my life points!

00:03:55.800 --> 00:04:01.760
The soul of the God sleeping inside the sacred ark, resurrect now!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:04.220
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.140
This is...

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:27.580
What?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.290
Come out, noble God!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:54.270
This is...

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.210
The third God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:04.100
I usually need three tributes to summon a God.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:12.830
The Winged Dragon of Ra's attack and defense points are equal to the sum of those three monsters.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:21.120
Serket ate Jinzo, Insect Queen, and The Legendary Fisherman.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:32.280
Therefore, my Winged Dragon of Ra has 5825 attack points.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.720
Jonouchi, you only have 200 life points.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:41.860
When my God attacks you this turn, you will lose.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.540
Yugi...

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:48.090
There's nothing Jonouchi can do against Ra.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:50.630
Is this the end?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:57.000
Rishido, you're in control of the copy of the God Card.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:01.000
You proved that you're a member of the Ishtar family.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:09.280
By witnessing Ra, no one will deny that you're Marik.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.240
Get ready, Jonouchi.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.340
Jonouchi...

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.250
Brother!

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:19.340
Jonouchi, your role is over.

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:23.340
When you lose, be proud that you were a good lab rat.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.080
Rishido!  God's power belongs to you!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.300
The Winged Dragon of Ra, attack!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:35.870
Oh no!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.310
Rishido, don't attack with that card!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.750
What's this aura?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:45.520
I sense anger and incredible hatred!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.440
Can it be?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:52.000
The real God in my deck is radiating an aura of anger!

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.800
Why doesn't the God attack?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.970
Something's weird.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.340
Look, Yugi!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.540
Ra's form is...

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.400
What's that?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.550
What?  That's not what Ra should look like!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.820
It's God's anger for using a copy card!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.070
What's going on?

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:51.550
God's anger will strike everyone who participates in this game.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.960
Jonouchi!

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.150
Brother!  Watch out!

00:07:58.860 --> 00:07:59.760
Rishido...

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:06.310
Destiny won't let me be his real son.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:10.170
It says I'm not qualified.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.060
The Millennium Rod...

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.240
He's not the real Marik!

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.120
Rishido!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.060
Marik...

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.400
Rishido!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.010
Rishido!

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:44.680
Master Marik...

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.280
Rishido!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.920
Pull yourself together!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.080
Jonouchi!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.330
Run, brother!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:01.020
Brother...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.300
Jonouchi, are you okay?

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.660
Back off.  The duel isn't over yet.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.590
Don't be dumb!  They're both down!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:15.630
Both duelists still have life points.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:19.760
It's against the rules for outsiders to touch a duelist during a duel.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.800
If you do, he'll be disqualified!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.580
This isn't the time!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.340
They were struck by lightning!

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.220
Calm down.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:33.420
The Duel Disk experience system isn't set to deal lethal damage.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:39.530
They're both unconscious because the visual images dealt psychological damage.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.620
Then who wins this duel?

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.230
Since neither duelist can continue, they forfeit-

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:51.270
Wait!  They both have exactly 200 life points.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.280
Wait for 5 minutes.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:58.940
Whoever stands up first within 5 minutes will be considered the winner.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:09:59.900
What?

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:00.900
Brother!

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.160
Jonouchi!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.550
Get up, Jonouchi!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.880
Please!  Get up, Jonouchi!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.290
Master Marik...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.080
Marik's other personality...

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:23.530
Come on, Jonouchi!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.220
Wake up, brother!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.800
Get up, Jonouchi!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.470
Willpower is all you have left!

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.640
3 minutes left.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:37.150
If neither can stand up in time, they're both disqualified.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.580
Master Marik...

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.800
Marik's other personality will awaken!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.820
Save me, Rishido!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.260
Rishido, save me!

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.190
Rishido!

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:52.360
Rishido!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:13.140
The ritual created another personality within Marik.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:19.220
A dark desire of hatred that wants to destroy everything!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:21.890
Tell me, Rishido...

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.090
Who should I hate?

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.000
Rishido?  What happened to your face?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.200
I cannot stop your suffering.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.470
Rishido...

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:40.600
But I can pledge my loyalty to you and your family.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:52.260
Rishido's loyalty suppressed Marik's dark spirit.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:55.760
But if Rishido falls...

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.320
Rishido...

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.570
I can't let that personality awaken.

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:10.700
What?

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.360
No way!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:13.870
Jonouchi!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:19.040
I can't afford to fall here...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.250
The match is decided.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.690
The winner is...

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.890
Master Marik...

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.240
Wake up, Jonouchi!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:36.160
Stand up, brother!

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.060
Jonouchi!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.940
Jonouchi, how long are you going to sleep?

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.020
Huh?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.870
What about class?

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.340
That's what I want to ask you, dummy!

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.810
Class ended a long time ago!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.500
Jonouchi, you need to get ready!

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:31.990
The Duel Monsters City Tournament is starting soon!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:36.050
You said that you were going to be #1 in the city!

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:37.370
Oh yeah.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.160
I have to check my deck.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.400
What's wrong with you?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.020
Your bag only contains cards?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.500
Your organizing ability is zero.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.210
Be quiet!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.950
You're an ordinary duelist.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.770
I'll beat that punk sometime!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.120
Forget about Kaiba for now!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.460
That's right.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.760
You have to rebuild your deck.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:13.960
Oh yeah.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.840
I wrote down what cards are in my deck.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.160
Huh?  Mai and Shizuka?

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.550
What are you doing here?

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:26.910
I came to see how you'll do in the tournament.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.270
It's your big day!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.510
I won't miss it!

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:31.980
You guys...

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.400
Hey, Jonouchi.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.110
Come with me.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.120
What's this?

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.660
Some senior punks gave it to me.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:52.570
One of them tried to pick a fight with me, so I beat him up.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:55.240
I guess they want revenge.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.360
When?

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.740
After school.  Behind the gym.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:00.680
Are you going?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.210
No.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:05.600
I don't care about something that dumb.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:12.570
I've decided that I won't do anything to make the people who care about me feel sad.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:13.920
Jonouchi...

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.020
It's done!

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.490
We made your deck, Jonouchi!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.260
Thanks, everyone!

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.080
Here.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.100
Thank you.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:27.170
I'm gonna win with these cards today!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:29.870
Let's hurry.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.010
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:38.280
Well...  It's...

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.650
I don't have the strength to stand up.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.980
You're too young to throw out your back!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.340
Sheesh...

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:49.320
You're such a pain.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:52.020
Instead of talking, lend me a hand-

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:10.450
Thanks, everyone.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:16.680
Jonouchi!

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.540
My brother stood up!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.520
Guys?

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.760
Huh?  What about the city tournament?

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:25.660
City tournament?

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.100
Are you daydreaming?

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.730
I...

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:33.930
Why is he unconscious?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.370
Oh yeah.  I remember.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:39.270
When he summoned Ra...

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.320
We were both struck.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.200
The winner of the duel is Katsuya Jonouchi!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.790
I'm the winner?

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.020
Jonouchi!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.300
Good job, brother!

00:16:58.480 --> 00:16:59.610
Oh yeah!

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:02.050
You did it, Jonouchi!

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:02.860
Yeah...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.770
I can't believe Jonouchi won.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.260
That duel was painful to watch.

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:16.800
But why didn't Ra materialize?  Why did it attack both players?

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:21.280
It was like an angry storm that stirred the heavens.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.050
Can it be that his card was...

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.220
Fake?

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.450
Pull yourself together!

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.090
Jonouchi...

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:36.030
I'm proud to have dueled you...

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.490
Yeah.  Same here.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.970
You're a true duelist.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.620
You're not Marik.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.000
Who are you?  Tell me.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.320
Don't worry about me.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.850
Please look after Master Marik.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.280
Marik?

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:00.220
He has the rod that the other guy just had.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:05.600
That's the real Millennium Rod.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.590
He's the real Marik!

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.840
Yes.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.030
I'm the real Marik.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.520
Marik.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.470
He has Ra.

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.640
Then who's Namu?

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:26.510
He's a disguise to get near you, Yugi.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.250
That punk is...

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.950
He brainwashed you!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:34.460
Sacrificing a friend is easy to do.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:35.890
Master Marik...

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:41.480
Compared to the grudge my family has been carrying for 3000 years.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:46.740
Yugi, we'll do whatever it takes to kill you-

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:48.650
You punk!

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:53.860
Please stop his other personality...

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.140
Other?

00:18:55.970 --> 00:19:02.820
If I fall, his power will awaken...

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.500
Hang in there!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.650
I'm finally free.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.740
I no longer need him.

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:36.950
I can't emerge when he's around.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.000
Emerge?

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:43.050
Compared to me, the other Marik is too nice.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:48.300
That has led to his downfall during the endgame of his duels.

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.720
He's afraid of the darkness.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:55.830
But I love the darkness.

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:57.970
The other Marik?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:02.010
So Marik has another personality?

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:07.160
I treat everyone as my cover.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:09.500
Especially him.

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.430
It'll be good if he's gone.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:15.400
Marik, how dare you!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:19.660
He was good for only one thing in this duel.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:27.270
He proved that only those affiliated with Millennium Items can use a God Card.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:28.920
Right, Kaiba?

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.480
How lame.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.880
I have no interest in occult items.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:38.010
But the God Card Obelisk is my servant.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.010
Really, Kaiba?

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:45.950
Maybe you still have the memories from 3000 years ago.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.480
Kaiba?

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:52.620
Can he be the person on the tablet?

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:56.760
Whatever.  We'll know the answer eventually.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:03.570
Marik's dark personality has finally awakened.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:07.710
No one can change the course of destiny.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:14.810
We're heading towards a future of despair without a single ray of light.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.080
Yugi...

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.180
The real millennium battle will begin.

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:23.120
We're heading towards true darkness.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.660
No one can retreat from it!

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.430
Namu is Marik?

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:52.230
That's horrible!  How dare he trick us!

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:56.060
Marik and Mai will face off in the third match of the tournament.

00:21:56.060 --> 00:22:00.120
Do your best, Mai!  We'll root hard for you!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.480
What?  You don't need us to root for you?

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:06.560
